The '''Enigma Cloak''' is an {{Epic}} [[Cloak]].

== Obtaining ==
The '''Enigma Cloak''' can be claimed from {{NPCSprite|Enigma}} for {{Motes|100}}.

== Usage ==
{{ItemInfo
|type = Cloak
|rarity = Epic
|special_effect = Find [[Enigma Souls]] across the [[Rift Dimension]]. <br> Each adds {{Stat|Rift Time|+20}} to this item. <br> Every {{Dark Purple|4 Souls}}, go back to {{NPCSprite|Enigma}} for more upgrades.
}}
For each {{Purple|Enigma Soul}} the player finds, an additional {{stat|rt|+20}} will be added to the cloak. Additionally, every {{Green|4}} {{Purple|Enigma Souls}} allows the player to talk to {{NPCSprite|Enigma}} to purchase {{Stat|spd|+2}} and {{Stat|mana regen|+4%}}.

=== Enigma Souls ===
{{Main|Enigma Souls}}
[[Enigma Souls]] can be found across the [[Rift Dimension]], in all sorts of places. Discovering an [[Enigma Soul]] will result in the following messages: {{TextSection|boxed=true|text={{Dialogue|
&5&lSOUL! &fYou unlocked an &5Enigma Soul&f!
You have found &d#&5\/52 Souls &fin the Rift Dimension!
&fYour &5Enigma Cloak&f now has &a+#ф Rift Time&f!
}}}}
For each [[Enigma Soul]] found, an additional {{stat|rt|+20}} is added to the '''Enigma Cloak''', capped at {{stat|rt|icononly=true|1,040}} once having discovered all {{DarkPurple|52/52}} [[Enigma Souls]]. An additional {{Stat|rift speed|+26}} and {{Stat|mana regen|+52%}} can be purchased from {{NPCSprite|Enigma}}.

